SUMMARY:Sunday Kettlebell Classes with Strength With Purpose
DESCRIPTION:It’s kettlebell for people of all levels of experience – come feel the burn! \nCome experience a kettlebell class on Sundays with a certified professional\, Demarco Crum from Strength With Purpose. You’ll learn new exercises to add to your routine while having fun and sharing a beverage of your choice with other awesome people. Class will be held outdoors unless weather prohibits\, then it’ll be inside the taproom. Your ticket includes your first beverage – including beer\, wine\, cider\, non-alcoholic options and more – so sign up today! \nGet your spot here! \nView on Facebook. \nHappens on the following Dates:\nSep 27\, 2026\, 10:30am to 11:30am Timezone: Eastern Time (US & Canada)\nOct 25\, 2026\, 10:30am to 11:30am Timezone: Eastern Time (US & Canada)\nNov 15\, 2026\, 10:30am to 11:30am Timezone: Eastern Time (US & Canada)
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/sunday-kettlebell-classes-with-strength-with-purpose/2026-09-27/
LOCATION:The Glass Jug Downtown\, 545 Foster Street\, Suite 10\, Durham\, 27701
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Sunday-Kettlebell-1.jpg
