SUMMARY:Durham Farmers' Market Fall Fest
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate spooky season at the Durham Farmers’ Market Fall Fest! 🎃🍁\nJoin us next Saturday\, October 31st\, from 8 AM to 12 PM at Durham Central Park for a morning packed with autumnal fun for the whole family.\n🎃 Annual Vendor Costume Contest: Vote for your favorite dressed-up market vendors!\n📸 Fall Photo Booth: Capture your memories at the market.\n🏆 Sack Racing & Pumpkin Ring Toss: Fun games for all ages.\n🎨 Face Painting: Transform into your favorite spooky or cute character.\n☕ Hot Cider & Seasonal Treats: Sip warm cider while you shop fresh fall produce\, baked goods\, and more!\nBring your friends\, wear your costumes\, and stock up on your local seasonal favorites! See you at the market! 🍂
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/durham-farmers-market-fall-fest/
