DESCRIPTION:Free – month-long event October 2026! \n“Movement and Color – Our Artistic Dance” features the work of Kerry Burch\, Soonja Cook and Paul J. Gala\, whose unique styles explore rhythm\, energy and emotion through vibrant color and expressive form! See more details on the event image! All works on display are for sale! \nHosted at Golden Belt Artists Main Gallery\, 800 Taylor Street\, Durham\, NC \nReception with refreshments: Friday\, October 16\, 2026\, 6:00-9:00 pm in conjunction with Third Friday Durham \nVisit anytime during Golden Belt Artists open hours:\nMon-Thurs 10am-6pm\nFri-Sat 10am-8pm\nSun 12pm-5pm \nWe hope to see you this month!
