SUMMARY:Halloween Drag Brunch
DESCRIPTION:Halloween Brunch\, but Make It Drag 👻✨ \nJoin us at Counting House inside 21c Museum Hotel Durham for The Garden of Frights and Delights\, a Halloween Drag Brunch featuring performances by Stormie Daie\, Naomi Dix\, and Spray J\, with music by DJ Luxe Posh. \nGuests can indulge in a decadent brunch buffet and enjoy two rounds of fabulous performances throughout the afternoon. Prefer to skip brunch? We’ve got you covered with a $25 General Admission ticket\, which includes entry to the show only. \nCome dressed for the occasion. Halloween costumes are highly encouraged\, and we’ll be hosting a Best Costume Contest during the event\, so this is your chance to go all out. \nExpect bold performances\, great music\, creative costumes\, and plenty of Halloween glamour in the heart of downtown Durham. \nSaturday\, October 31\nDoors: 11:30 AM | Show: 12:00 PM \n🎟️ $65 Brunch Ticket (includes brunch buffet + show)\n🎟️ $25 General Admission Ticket (show only)\n21+ \nGrab your tickets while spots are still available and celebrate Halloween with us at 21c Durham. 🖤🎃✨
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/halloween-drag-brunch-2/
LOCATION:21c Museum Hotel\, 111 N Corcoran St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Updated-Halloween-Flyer-Drag-Brunch.jpg
GEO:35.9959669;-78.9018154
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=21c Museum Hotel 111 N Corcoran St Durham NC 27701 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=111 N Corcoran St:geo:-78.9018154,35.9959669
END:VEVENT
