SUMMARY:Deep Creeps Halloween Party at Kingfisher and Queeny’s
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Saturday\, October 31\, 8pm-2am for The Deep Creeps: a joint Kingfisher & Queeny’s Halloween throw down complete with local DJs (TO BE ANNOUNCED!)\, a hand made costume contest with a $400 cash prize\, special halloween drinks (read: spooky shots)\, dancing\, & MORE.  We’re back this year with advance VIP tickets\, which guarantee entry before 9pm\, expedited entry line after 9pm\, and a VIP-only Halloween drink. Only 100 tickets are available and they’re going quick. (Last year\, in 2025\, we had more than 900 people come through our doors. VIP tickets sold out by October 25.) \nSnag VIP tickets on our website at uvhospitality.com/creeps – otherwise\, it’s $15 at the door and free for service industry folks!
