SUMMARY:RECITAL (Miss Victoria’s Version)
DESCRIPTION:The next iteration of RECITAL will be presented in the first annual (!!) Durham Fringe Festival. \nThis year\, Miss Vikki is on sabbatical (getting work done)\, and Ms. Victoria has seized the opportunity to perform a one-woman show. [applause break] \nRECITAL (Ms. Victoria’s Version) is an invitation to join iconic diva Ms. V as she embarks on the hero’s journey. She’ll encounter trials and tribulations delivered through song\, dance\, comedic monologues\, and suuuper professional slideshows. And we promise\, she’ll be the only one onstage. \nRECITAL (Miss Victoria’s Version) will be performed at Stancyzk’s on November 1st\, and we have two shows — one at 6 PM and one at 9 PM. You read that right\, we’re performing for ONE NIGHT ONLY!! \nThis year’s show will feature original works by Alyssa Noble\, Chris Strauss\, Megan Ross\, Amy Blakely\, Eudora\, Kaitlin Fox\, Laura Grant\, Baba McDaniel Roberts\, and Poah West. \nOur tickets are NOW ON SALE\, and all ticketing is being done through the Durham Fringe Festival. Because of this ticketing structure\, we are unable to offer sliding scale ticketing this year; all tickets will be $20. If you’d like to subsidize a ticket for another patron\, or if you’d like to make a gift to RECITAL beyond the ticket price\, please email us at recitaldurham (at) gmail.com to coordinate! We recommend buying early!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/recital-miss-victorias-version/2026-11-01/1/
LOCATION:Stanczyks\, 1007 W Main St\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Comedy,Dance,LGBTQ,Live Performance,Music
