DESCRIPTION:Test your knowledge against other Jug drinkers Tuesdays at Glass Jug Downtown for our FREE weekly trivia night. Bring a team of your smartest friends to win prizes! \nWe’ll be alternating weeks between General Knowledge and Music Trivia so there’s something for everyone\, no matter what you’re an expert at. Our Hosts Ash and Wesley will have multiple rounds for you to prove your skills against other teams. Themes listed on socials each week so stay tuned. \nSo grab a drink and see if you can come out on top! \nView on Facebook.
